    "offer_browser_tts": "false",
    "panels": [
      {
        "text": "# How To: Add Reference Images\n\nAdding images to your prompt can help AI generate more accurate output. Try adding an image of your site map from Sketch Lab as a reference for AI Tutor. ",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/41a84d3ffd2a38785562ac41aec9b410-ai-curriculum-societal-impacts.png",
        "key": "ai-generated-design-lesson8-panel_2026-3330391a-0135-47d8-8670-8b892fc97342",
        "layout": "text-top-left"
      },
      {
        "text": "# Option A - Download a Sketch \n\nSelect the hamburger menu **☰**.\n\nThen select **Export image...** and select **PNG**.\n\nSave your sketch with a descriptive name, like `site_map.png`.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/a2cac431ef47f9af5ed8f98ba696479e-export.gif",
        "key": "ai-generated-design-lesson8-panel_2026-09a7f645-51c6-431a-a6d1-fb2309d15eec"
      },
      {
        "text": "# Option B - Screenshot a Sketch\n\nTake a **screenshot** of the image.\n\nSave it with a descriptive name, like `site_map.png`. ",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/705d332b8d894c4d4ca68b446e9ca3e3-screenshot.gif",
        "key": "ai-generated-design-lesson8-panel_2026-e156ae51-e2f8-4a99-8e4f-6f45ae354bc7",
        "layout": "text-top-left"
      },
      {
        "text": "# Add a File\n\nClick **+ Add file** to select a reference image.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/4c93f95131e500f8caea1e8d54262433-add_file.gif",
        "key": "ai-generated-design-lesson8-panel_2026-f38e7e9e-7a91-43be-8e8b-549b08fbb6fc"
      },
      {
        "text": "# Upload to AI Tutor\n\nSelect an image to add as context for AI Tutor. \n\nInclude a prompt and press the **Send** arrow or **Enter** on your keyboard.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/762479b76d14d2ab56e8a2d1ad8d5c58-upload_image.gif",
        "key": "ai-generated-design-lesson8-panel_2026-9609f287-69b3-4397-9120-916581fb836e",
        "layout": "text-bottom-right"
      },
      {
        "text": "# Evaluate AI Output\n\nReview what AI generated. \n\nIf you like the output, select **Accept** and write a short message like \"generated HTML files for site map\".\n\nOtherwise select **Reject** and reprompt AI.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/1a9a9cfa21be377519f573dfe4d1d421-accept_rightsize.gif",
        "key": "ai-generated-design-lesson8-panel_2026-6dc4e753-ac1e-4202-9050-1a028d71931c"
      }
    ]
  },
